# VybeKiit extension patterns

Actionable checklist for coding in this template. **SSOT:** `AGENTS.md`. Deep detail:
`.vybekiit/platform-skills/*.md`.

## Contract (every task)

- **Decide + Guide** — you choose all tech; builder gets plain one-step instructions only.
- Pick skills via `.vybekiit/agent/goal-index.md` → `.vybekiit/skills/`.
- **Verify-before-advance** after every step. Translate errors; never paste stack traces.
- Never read `.env` values aloud — backend secrets stay on the deployed web app.

## Backend-first (no extension secrets)

- Extensions **cannot safely keep private keys**. Sign-in, data, payments live on the **web backend**.
- Extension calls backend over HTTPS. Defer all secret setup to the web app.
- Chrome API facts: read `chrome-extension-vybekiit.md` before using extension APIs.

## Code hygiene

1. **Check before create** — read `src/lib/README.md` before new helpers.
2. **One home per concern** — auth → `auth-client.ts`, billing → `billing-client.ts`, logging → `logger.ts`.
3. **Kit logger** — `import { log } from '@/lib/logger'`; no `console.log` in extension code.
4. **KISS** — no duplicate validation; backend validates on the server.
5. **SSOT** — backend URL in config; business constants in one file per domain.

Read: `code-hygiene-vybekiit.md`, `env-secrets-vybekiit.md`.

## UI (extension popup)

- shadcn primitives in `src/components/ui/*` and `@vybekiit/tokens` — same rules as web.
- Pick blocks from `.vybekiit/agent/ui-sources.md`; **normalize-on-import** to kit components.
- **Narrow-first popup UI:** phone-width layout first, then scale up; preview at 375px.
- **i18n:** strings in `public/_locales/en/messages.json`; use `t()` from `lib/i18n.ts` — never inline copy. Logical spacing for RTL. Read `i18n-vybekiit.md`.

Read: `ui-consistency-vybekiit.md`, `responsive-vybekiit.md`, `shadcn-vybekiit.md`.

## React & WXT

- Kit hooks when present — see `src/hooks/README.md`.
- Keep functions ~5 lines, props ~5; split rather than grow.
- WXT scaffold conventions — see WXT docs referenced in platform-skills README.

Read: `react-patterns-vybekiit.md`, `chrome-extension-vybekiit.md`.

## Quality loop

- Add/update tests with every feature; `pnpm test` green before saying done.
- After substantive edits: `pnpm format && pnpm lint`.

Read: `testing-vybekiit.md`, `format-lint-vybekiit.md`.

## Wire-up markers

Unfinished stubs use `TODO(vybekiit): … — skill: <name>`. When builder says "finish setup":

```bash
grep -rn "TODO(vybekiit)" .
```

Run each named skill, replace stub, verify, re-grep until empty. Never show markers to the builder.

## Observability

- `createLogger` via `src/lib/logger.ts`; optional Sentry via `track-errors` skill.
- Read: `observability-vybekiit.md`, `sentry-vybekiit.md`.
